<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>P31 Docs</title><style is:global>:root{--bg:#0a0c10;--s:#12151c;--b:#252a38;--t:#c8cdd8;--t2:#8b92a5;--a:#8b5cf6;--g:#00d68f}*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--t);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.6}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);position:sticky;top:0;background:rgba(10,12,16,.95);z-index:10}.logo{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:var(--a);text-decoration:none}nav{display:flex;gap:16px}nav a{color:var(--t2);text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}nav a:hover{color:var(--t)}.hero{padding:60px 24px 40px;text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto}.hero h1{font-size:32px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--a),#5cb8ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}.hero p{font-size:15px;color:var(--t2)}section{padding:40px 24px;max-width:960px;margin:0 auto}.section-alt{background:var(--s);border-top:1px solid var(--b);border-bottom:1px solid var(--b);max-width:none}.section-alt>div{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto}h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-.01em}h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--a)}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:12px}.card{background:var(--s);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}.card h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}.card p{font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);line-height:1.5}.card code{background:var(--bg);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:3px;font-size:11px;color:var(--g)}.runbook{background:var(--s);border:1px solid var(--b);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;margin-bottom:10px}.runbook h4{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--a)}.runbook p{font-size:12px;color:var(--t2);margin-top:4px}.runbook pre{background:var(--bg);border-radius:6px;padding:10px;font-size:11px;color:var(--g);overflow-x:auto;margin-top:8px}.badge{display:inline-block;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:10px;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}.bd-ok{background:rgba(0,214,143,.15);color:var(--g)}.bd-api{background:rgba(139,92,246,.15);color:var(--a)}.footer{padding:24px;text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:var(--t2);border-top:1px solid var(--b)}.footer a{color:var(--a)}@media(min-width:768px){.layout{display:flex;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}.sidebar{width:220px;padding:24px 16px;border-right:1px solid var(--b);position:sticky;top:60px;height:calc(100vh - 60px);overflow-y:auto}.sidebar a{display:block;padding:4px 0;color:var(--t2);text-decoration:none;font-size:12px}.sidebar a:hover{color:var(--t)}.content{flex:1;padding:24px}}</style></head><body><header><a href="/" class="logo">◇ P31 Docs</a><nav><a href="#api">API</a><a href="#runbooks">Runbooks</a><a href="#start">Quick Start</a><a href="#mcp">MCP Tools</a></nav></header><div class="hero"><h1>P31 Sovereign Mesh — Documentation</h1><p>API references, MCP tool specs, runbooks, and developer onboarding for 55 Workers, 10 D1 databases, and 16 Durable Objects.</p></div><div class="layout"><nav class="sidebar"><a href="#api">API Reference</a><a href="#workers">Workers</a><a href="#mcp">MCP Tools</a><a href="#runbooks">Runbooks</a><a href="#d1">D1 & DO</a><a href="#start">Quick Start</a><a href="#deploy">Deploy Guide</a><a href="#security">Security</a></nav><main class="content"><section id="api"><h2>API Reference</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h4>Gateway <span class="badge bd-api">REST</span></h4><p>Main API gateway at <code>gateway.p31ca.org</code>. Rate-limited at 100 req/min per IP. JWT auth required for <code>/ai/*</code> and <code>/api/*</code> routes.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Auth <span class="badge bd-api">REST</span></h4><p>JWT issuance + WebAuthn passkey management at <code>auth.p31ca.org</code>. POST <code>/api/auth/login</code> with pseudonym and DID.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Federation <span class="badge bd-api">ActivityPub</span></h4><p>ActivityPub bridge at <code>federation.p31ca.org</code>. GET <code>/actor</code> returns actor document. POST <code>/inbox</code> accepts Follow + Create activities.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Care API <span class="badge bd-api">REST</span></h4><p>Care proof management at <code>care.p31ca.org</code>. Cursor-paginated GET <code>/api/care/proofs</code>. POST <code>/api/care/proof/:id/export</code> for court-ready docs.</p></div></div></section><section id="mcp" class="section-alt"><div><h2>MCP Tools</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h4>p31-mcp-server</h4><p>95+ tools, 15 hook types. MCP 2025-06-18 spec compliant. Origin validation, audience-checked JWT tokens.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>mcp-justice</h4><p>Sovereign justice protocol tools: care_proof_create, care_proof_verify, care_proof_export, guardian_attest, fhir_search.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>mcp-x402-gateway</h4><p>HTTP 402 payment protocol gateway. LOVE token HMAC-SHA256 with 60s TTL.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="runbooks"><h2>Runbooks</h2><div class="runbook"><h4>Emergency: Worker Down</h4><p>1. Check status.p31ca.org · 2. <code>wrangler tail &lt;worker&gt;</code> · 3. Rollback to previous version · 4. Escalate if >5min</p><pre>wrangler tail p31-gateway --status error</pre></div><div class="runbook"><h4>Emergency: DO Alarm Loop</h4><p>1. Identify offending DO via kill-switch alert · 2. Check <code>getAlarm()</code> guard · 3. Redeploy with fix · 4. If runaway costs: <code>wrangler delete &lt;do-class&gt;</code></p><pre>pnpm run verify:do-alarms</pre></div><div class="runbook"><h4>Routine: Secret Rotation</h4><p>1. Run dry-run: <code>pnpm run rotate:secrets auth-chain</code> · 2. Verify chains match · 3. Execute: <code>pnpm run rotate:secrets:execute auth-chain</code></p><pre>node scripts/rotate-keys.mjs auth-chain --execute</pre></div><div class="runbook"><h4>Routine: D1 Backup</h4><p>Daily automatic cold snapshots to R2 (phos-backup Worker). Manual: <code>wrangler d1 execute love-ledger --remote --command "SELECT * FROM love_chain LIMIT 100"</code></p></div></section><section id="d1" class="section-alt"><div><h2>D1 Databases & Durable Objects</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h4>love-ledger <span class="badge bd-ok">651 KB</span></h4><p>Shared by 16+ workers. Append-only, hash-chained. Tables: love_chain, care_proofs, receipts, governance_proposals, governance_votes.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>p31-status-db <span class="badge bd-ok">794 KB</span></h4><p>Shared by p31-status + command-center. Fleet health check records.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>16 Durable Objects</h4><p>AgentRuntime, RevenueTracker, ContractEngine, GovernanceEngineDO, TallyRoom, MembraneCoordinator, GameSessionDO, RoomCoordinatorDO, AppSupervisor, ArtifactRegistryDO, SandboxDO, SignalingRoom, BondingRoomDO, CrdtSessionDO, SyncState, DeviceRegistryDO.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="start"><h2>Quick Start</h2><pre>git clone https://github.com/p31labs/sovereign.git
cd sovereign
pnpm install
pnpm run setup
pnpm run verify
pnpm run test
pnpm run deploy:platform --env staging</pre></section><section id="deploy" class="section-alt"><div><h2>Deploy Guide</h2><pre># Deploy staging
git push origin staging

# Deploy production (with migration gate)
git push origin main

# Deploy single worker
cd workers/gateway && npx wrangler deploy --env production

# Gradual rollout (zero-downtime)
wrangler versions upload
wrangler versions deploy --version-id <id> --percentage 10
wrangler versions deploy --version-id <id> --percentage 100</pre></div></section><section id="security"><h2>Security Architecture</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h4>Auth Methods (5)</h4><p>JWT HS256, DID Ed25519/ML-DSA-65, CF Access JWT, PSK (worker-to-worker), WebAuthn passkeys.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>PQC Migration</h4><p>ML-DSA-65 co-signatures on all Workers. Hybrid TLS (X25519 + ML-KEM). DID documents include PQC keys.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>Secret Management</h4><p>wrangler secret put for each Worker. Chain-based rotation via scripts/rotate-keys.mjs. Migrating to Cloudflare Secrets Store.</p></div><div class="card"><h4>DO Alarm Safety</h4><p>Every setAlarm() guarded by getAlarm(). CI gate fails if missing. Kill-switch Worker monitors DO row read/write budgets hourly.</p></div></div></section></main></div><footer class="footer"><p>P31 Labs, Inc. — William R. Johnson (AuDHD) — <a href="mailto:willyj1587@gmail.com">willyj1587@gmail.com</a> — <a href="https://github.com/p31labs">github.com/p31labs</a></p></footer></body></html>